tesseract-planning provides CMake targets tesseract::*.
Use the vcpkg port name (this pulls in tesseract-robotics, not OCR):

  find_package(tesseract-planning CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE
      tesseract::command_language
      tesseract::motion_planners_ompl
      tesseract::motion_planners_trajopt
      tesseract::motion_planners_descartes
      tesseract::task_composer)

OMPL VAMP SIMD (optional): set OMPLRealVectorMoveProfile::use_vamp = true when the
manipulator joint names/order match a built-in VAMP robot (Panda, UR5, Fetch).
Otherwise Tesseract collision is used.

Plugin DLLs are in bin/; put that directory on PATH at runtime.
